OL,3,GNEWSAWork under way for new Oxford
OL,4,Aburial ground
OL,5,
OL,6,FConstruction has begun on a new
OL,7,Fcemetery for people who have died in
OL,8,FOxford.
OL,10,FThe Oxford Burial Meadow will be on the
OL,11,Foutskirts of Horspath, just outside the
OL,12,Fcity's ring road, and is expected to
OL,13,Fcost #2.4m.
OL,15,FThe site covers 17 acres and is
OL,16,Fexpected to accommodate 45 years of
OL,17,Fburials.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
