OL,3,GNEWSAWork under way for new Oxford
OL,4,Aburial ground
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnna Railton, deputy leader of Oxford
OL,7,FCity Council, said it would help
OL,8,Faddress the city's shortage of burial
OL,9,Fspace. "We've got to the point where we
OL,10,Fare sort of taking out benches and
OL,11,Ffootpaths to make more space to bury
OL,12,Fpeople," she said.
